14:26:55.621 THIS CHANNEL ANSWERS PACKETS - the default since 2026-09-14. It used to need
14:26:55.621   --set-field-probe, a flag every caller passed and whose absence cost a launch;
14:26:55.621   --silent-channel is the way to turn answering off now, and it is only for
14:26:55.621   eliminating the channel as a variable.
14:26:55.621   This channel answers: the migration hello with a SetField
14:26:55.621   carrying the character's real record (presence[0] the stat block, presence[2]
