14:26:55.621   NPC dialogue, mobs spawning and moving, an unequip that survives a map change.
14:26:55.621   NOT yet seen on screen: the shop counter, the quest journal, the channel
14:26:55.621   switch. Dropping an item is refused on purpose - there is nowhere to put it.
